43
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:38,600
some streets have only a few houses on

44
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:41,000
them so publishing data at address or

45
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,000
street level would risk breaching the

46
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,399
privacy of the people who live here

47
00:01:45,399 --> 00:01:48,240
agencies that publish data about places

48
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:50,240
have to choose which areas they publish

49
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:53,240
data for for example the government

50
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,280
publishes estimates of poverty in each

51
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:57,560
