52
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:59,880
Aggregates that data into estimates of

53
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:02,880
poverty at local Authority level and at

54
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:06,360
Regional level and at National level

55
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,520
publishing data for administrative areas

56
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:11,280
like Wards buroughs and regions is

57
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,920
useful for lots of reasons for example

58
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,800
it could help a local counselor

59
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,120
understand problems their own Ward might

60
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:20,519
face but one issue with administrative

61
00:02:20,519 --> 00:02:23,480
areas is that their boundaries tend to

62
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:25,959
change every few years to reflect

63
00:02:25,959 --> 00:02:28,680
changes in population that makes it

64
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,720
